{"seq":4,"slug":"deployment-strategies","title":"部署策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies","wordCount":986,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"部署策略\">部署策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>部署策略决定新版本如何替换旧版本，本质是在<strong>风险控制、资源消耗与回滚速度</strong>之间权衡。主流策略包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>滚动更新（Rolling Update）</strong>：逐步替换 Pod，Kubernetes 默认策略，通用生产场景。</li>\n<li><strong>蓝绿部署（Blue-Green）</strong>：同时维护两套环境，通过切换流量入口实现瞬间切换与快速回滚。</li>\n<li><strong>金丝雀发布（Canary）</strong>：先放小比例流量验证，再逐步扩大，最安全。</li>\n<li><strong>重建部署（Recreate）</strong>：先停后起，有停机时间，仅适合开发测试。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与之配套的是<strong>自动回滚</strong>——基于健康检查与监控指标，在检测到异常时自动恢复到上一个稳定版本。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"部署策略概览\">部署策略概览</h2><p>部署策略决定了新版本如何替换旧版本。不同的策略在风险控制、资源消耗和回滚速度之间做出不同的权衡。选择合适的部署策略是实现零停机和安全发布的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 部署策略对比&#10;        REC[重建部署&lt;br/&gt;Recreate]&#10;        ROLL[滚动更新&lt;br/&gt;Rolling]&#10;        BG[蓝绿部署&lt;br/&gt;Blue-Green]&#10;        CAN[金丝雀发布&lt;br/&gt;Canary]&#10;        AB[A/B 测试&lt;br/&gt;A/B Testing]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 部署策略对比\n        REC[重建部署&lt;br/&gt;Recreate]\n        ROLL[滚动更新&lt;br/&gt;Rolling]\n        BG[蓝绿部署&lt;br/&gt;Blue-Green]\n        CAN[金丝雀发布&lt;br/&gt;Canary]\n        AB[A/B 测试&lt;br/&gt;A/B Testing]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>停机时间</th>\n<th>资源开销</th>\n<th>回滚速度</th>\n<th>风险级别</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重建部署</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>开发/测试环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动更新</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>通用生产环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝绿部署</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>高（2x）</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>关键服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金丝雀发布</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>大规模服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A/B 测试</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>功能实验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"滚动更新\">滚动更新</h2><p>滚动更新（Rolling Update）逐步用新版本 Pod 替换旧版本，是 Kubernetes Deployment 的默认策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api&#10;spec:&#10;  replicas: 4&#10;  strategy:&#10;    type: RollingUpdate&#10;    rollingUpdate:&#10;      maxSurge: 1&#10;      maxUnavailable: 0&#10;  template:&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: api&#10;          image: myapi:2.0.0&#10;          readinessProbe:&#10;            httpGet:&#10;              path: /ready&#10;              port: 3000&#10;            initialDelaySeconds: 10&#10;            periodSeconds: 5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RollingUpdate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rollingUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      maxSurge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      maxUnavailable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapi:2.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          readinessProbe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/ready</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            initialDelaySeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            periodSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 滚动更新过程&#10;        T1[时间 1] --&gt; |v1 x4| S1[v1 v1 v1 v1]&#10;        T2[时间 2] --&gt; |+v2 -v1| S2[v2 v1 v1 v1]&#10;        T3[时间 3] --&gt; |+v2 -v1| S3[v2 v2 v1 v1]&#10;        T4[时间 4] --&gt; |+v2 -v1| S4[v2 v2 v2 v1]&#10;        T5[时间 5] --&gt; |+v2 -v1| S5[v2 v2 v2 v2]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 滚动更新过程\n        T1[时间 1] --&gt; |v1 x4| S1[v1 v1 v1 v1]\n        T2[时间 2] --&gt; |+v2 -v1| S2[v2 v1 v1 v1]\n        T3[时间 3] --&gt; |+v2 -v1| S3[v2 v2 v1 v1]\n        T4[时间 4] --&gt; |+v2 -v1| S4[v2 v2 v2 v1]\n        T5[时间 5] --&gt; |+v2 -v1| S5[v2 v2 v2 v2]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl rollout status deployment/api&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout history deployment/api&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout undo deployment/api\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 设置 <code>maxUnavailable: 0</code> 确保更新过程中始终有足够的 Pod 处理请求。配合 <code>readinessProbe</code> 使用，只有新 Pod 通过就绪检查后才会终止旧 Pod，实现真正的零停机更新。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"蓝绿部署\">蓝绿部署</h2><p>蓝绿部署同时维护两个完全相同的环境——蓝色（当前版本）和绿色（新版本）。通过切换流量入口实现瞬间切换和快速回滚。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api-green&#10;  labels:&#10;    app: api&#10;    version: green&#10;spec:&#10;  replicas: 4&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: api&#10;      version: green&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      labels:&#10;        app: api&#10;        version: green&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: api&#10;          image: myapi:2.0.0&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api&#10;spec:&#10;  selector:&#10;    app: api&#10;    version: green&#10;  ports:&#10;    - port: 80&#10;      targetPort: 3000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</