A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">green</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      targetPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    LB[负载均衡器]&#10;    subgraph 蓝色环境 v1.0&#10;        B1[Pod v1]&#10;        B2[Pod v1]&#10;        B3[Pod v1]&#10;        B4[Pod v1]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 绿色环境 v2.0&#10;        G1[Pod v2]&#10;        G2[Pod v2]&#10;        G3[Pod v2]&#10;        G4[Pod v2]&#10;    end&#10;    LB --&gt;|切换 selector| G1&#10;    LB --&gt;|切换 selector| G2&#10;    LB --&gt;|切换 selector| G3&#10;    LB --&gt;|切换 selector| G4&#10;    LB -.-&gt;|回滚| B1\">graph TD\n    LB[负载均衡器]\n    subgraph 蓝色环境 v1.0\n        B1[Pod v1]\n        B2[Pod v1]\n        B3[Pod v1]\n        B4[Pod v1]\n    end\n    subgraph 绿色环境 v2.0\n        G1[Pod v2]\n        G2[Pod v2]\n        G3[Pod v2]\n        G4[Pod v2]\n    end\n    LB --&gt;|切换 selector| G1\n    LB --&gt;|切换 selector| G2\n    LB --&gt;|切换 selector| G3\n    LB --&gt;|切换 selector| G4\n    LB -.-&gt;|回滚| B1</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl patch service api -p &#39;{&quot;spec&quot;:{&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;version&quot;:&quot;green&quot;}}}&#39;&#10;&#10;kubectl patch service api -p &#39;{&quot;spec&quot;:{&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;version&quot;:&quot;blue&quot;}}}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> patch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"spec\":{\"selector\":{\"version\":\"green\"}}}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> patch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"spec\":{\"selector\":{\"version\":\"blue\"}}}'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>蓝绿部署阶段</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准备</td>\n<td>部署新版本到绿色环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证</td>\n<td>对绿色环境进行冒烟测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换</td>\n<td>将 Service selector 指向绿色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观察</td>\n<td>监控错误率和性能指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理/回滚</td>\n<td>成功则清理蓝色，失败则回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"金丝雀发布\">金丝雀发布</h2><p>金丝雀发布（Canary Release）将新版本先暴露给一小部分流量，验证无误后再逐步扩大到全量。这是大规模服务最安全的发布策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#