lor:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapi:1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">port</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      targetPort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 金丝雀发布流量分配&#10;        SVC[Service] --&gt;|90%| STABLE[Stable v1&lt;br/&gt;9 Pods]&#10;        SVC --&gt;|10%| CANARY[Canary v2&lt;br/&gt;1 Pod]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 金丝雀发布流量分配\n        SVC[Service] --&gt;|90%| STABLE[Stable v1&lt;br/&gt;9 Pods]\n        SVC --&gt;|10%| CANARY[Canary v2&lt;br/&gt;1 Pod]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发布阶段</th>\n<th>流量比例</th>\n<th>持续时间</th>\n<th>验证指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始金丝雀</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td>15-30 分钟</td>\n<td>错误率、延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩大范围</td>\n<td>25-50%</td>\n<td>30-60 分钟</td>\n<td>业务指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量发布</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>全面监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Kubernetes 原生的金丝雀发布通过调整 Pod 副本数控制流量比例，粒度较粗。使用 Istio 或 Flagger 等服务网格工具可以实现精确的百分比流量控制，并支持基于指标的自动晋升和回滚。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动回滚\">自动回滚</h2><p>自动回滚是部署安全的最后一道防线。基于健康检查和监控指标，在检测到异常时自动恢复到上一个稳定版本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl rollout undo deployment/api&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout undo deployment/api --to-revision=3&#10;&#10;kubectl rollout history deployment/api\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to-revision=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    DEPLOY[部署新版本] --&gt; CHECK{健康检查}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|通过| MONITOR[监控指标]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|失败| ROLLBACK[自动回滚]&#10;    MONITOR --&gt;|正常| SUCCESS[发布成功]&#10;    MONITOR --&gt;|异常| ROLLBACK&#10;    ROLLBACK --&gt; STABLE[恢复稳定版本]\">graph TD\n    DEPLOY[部署新版本] --&gt; CHECK{健康检查}\n    CHECK --&gt;|通过| MONITOR[监控指标]\n    CHECK --&gt;|失败| ROLLBACK[自动回滚]\n    MONITOR --&gt;|正常| SUCCESS[发布成功]\n    MONITOR --&gt;|异常| ROLLBACK\n    ROLLBACK --&gt; STABLE[恢复稳定版本]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回滚触发条件</th>\n<th>检测方式</th>\n<th>响应时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pod 启动失败</td>\n<td>progressDeadline</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>健康检查失败</td>\n<td>livenessProbe</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率突增</td>\n<td>监控告警</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟异常</td>\n<td>P99 延迟告警</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((部署策略))&#10;    滚动更新&#10;      逐步替换&#10;      maxSurge / maxUnavailable&#10;      零停机&#10;    蓝绿部署&#10;      双环境&#10;      瞬间切换&#10;      快速回滚&#10;    金丝雀发布&#10;      小流量验证&#10;      逐步扩大&#10;      最安全&#10;    自动回滚&#10;      健康检查&#10;      指标告警&#10;      版本历史\">mindmap\n  root((部署策略))\n    滚动更新\n      逐步替换\n      maxSurge / maxUnavailable\n      零停机\n    蓝绿部署\n      双环境\n      瞬间切换\n      快速回滚\n    金丝雀发布\n      小流量验证\n      逐步扩大\n      最安全\n    自动回滚\n      健康检查\n      指标告警\n      版本历史</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>滚动更新</strong>是 Kubernetes 默认策略，通过 <code>maxSurge</code> 和 <code>maxUnavailable</code> 控制更新节奏。</li>\n<li><strong>蓝绿部署</strong>同时维护两个完整环境，通过切换 Service selector 实现瞬间流量切换和秒级回滚。</li>\n<li><strong>金丝雀发布</strong>先将新版本暴露给小比例流量，验证通过后逐步扩大，是大规模服务最安全的策略。</li>\n<li><code>progressDeadlineSeconds</code> 配合健康检查实现部署超时自动检测，<code>rollout undo</code> 一键回滚。</li>\n<li>完善的部署策略应结合自动化监控和告警，实现从异常检测到自动回滚的闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"部署策略","id":"部署策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"部署策略概览","id":"部署策略概览"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动更新","id":"滚动更新"},{"level":2,"text":"蓝绿部署","id":"蓝绿部署"},{"level":2,"text":"金丝雀发布","id":"金丝雀发布"},{"level":2,"text":"自动回滚","id":"自动回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"制品与镜像仓库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/artifact-and-registry"},"next":{"title":"日志体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/monitoring-and-operations/logging-stack"}}